    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it doesn't feel like i'm trying my best. it feels like everything i do just makes it harder for them. they're always stressed, always worrying about me, and i can see it in their eyes. if i wasn't in the picture, maybe they could finally just breathe. maybe things would actually be easier for them if they didn't have to worry about me all the time.",
